            "stage": "apply",
            "requirement": "Tamil knowledge must meet the notification’s education or TNPSC language-test conditions. Accepted evidence includes study with Tamil as a language, specified Tamil-medium education, or the TNPSC Second Class Language Test (Full Test). Evidence is requested with the application. Clause 4.4.3 allows some appointees without uploaded evidence to pass that test within two years of appointment, but excludes posts 1695, 1694, 3799 and 3833 from that provision. Confirm the chosen post and applicable exception. No CEFR/JLPT equivalence is specified.",
