            "requirement": "Paper I Part A is a Tamil eligibility test at SSLC standard: 100 questions, 150 marks. At least 40% (60 marks) is required before other listed papers/parts are evaluated. Candidates claiming the disability exemption must declare it in the application and upload the prescribed certificate. This is a notice-specific examination requirement, not a CEFR or JLPT level.",
